    "# GraphMS-Net \u2014 ResEncM-250 TRUE HYBRID v3.4.2 \u2014 GUIDE-LEAN AUDITED\n",
    "\n",
    "> **v3.4.2 is a recovery-only hotfix.**\n",
    "> Scientific v3.4.1 is unchanged. Validation remains every 5 epochs; only durable\n",
    "> restart persistence is increased to every epoch so Colab disconnects do not\n",
    "> repeatedly discard completed epochs 1\u20134.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Binding priorities\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Follow the supplied GraphMS-Net pipeline directly.\n",
    "2. Highest legitimate metric without extra model families or rescue machinery.\n",
    "3. No unnecessary sophisticated search/tournament workload.\n",
    "4. Preserve completed ResEncM-250 Stage-5/6 work.\n",
    "5. No outer-fold label may affect a model applied to that outer fold.\n",
    "6. Recovery/storage engineering is not scientific methodology.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Scope truth-lock\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook is the **guide-contained segmentation branch**, not a claim that all 16 stages are re-executed here.\n",
    "\n",
    "- Stages 4\u201311, 15 and segmentation Stage 16 are implemented here using one fixed guide-listed path.\n",
    "- Stage 5/6 expensive ResEncM assets are reused only after SHA verification.\n",
    "- Stages 2\u20133 remain the frozen ResEncM/nnU-Net preprocessing+augmentation lineage; reproducing the guide's literal BET/N4/ANTs + every listed augmentation would require retraining and is therefore **not falsely claimed** here.\n",
    "- Stages 12\u201314 follow only after segmentation is frozen.\n",
    "\n",
    "No additional candidate-search/tournament framework is introduced.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Single downstream path\n",
    "\n",
    "`FLAIR/T1/T2`\n",
    "\u2192 frozen **ResEncM-250**\n",
    "\u2192 four-scale CNN features\n",
    "\u2192 patch graph\n",
    "\u2192 **GAT**\n",
    "\u2192 **CNN+GNN concatenation**\n",
    "\u2192 **SE attention**\n",
    "\u2192 **self-attention**\n",
    "\u2192 **multi-scale fusion**\n",
    "\u2192 transposed-convolution decoder + skip\n",
    "\u2192 final **1\u00d71\u00d71 lesion head**\n",
    "\u2192 **Dice+BCE**\n",
    "\u2192 threshold **0.5**\n",
    "\u2192 3-D connected components\n",
    "\u2192 remove components **<10 voxels**\n",
    "\u2192 DSC / IoU / sensitivity / specificity / HD95\n",
    "\u2192 5-fold mean \u00b1 sample SD.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Explicitly absent\n",
    "\n",
    "No fusion/loss/optimizer/scheduler tournament.\n",
    "No Stage-11 threshold sweep.\n",
    "No label smoothing.\n",
    "No stochastic depth / DropPath.\n",
    "No AMSGrad.\n",
    "No LR warmup.\n",
    "No CATMIL, CutMix, DBL, CC-DiceCE, meta-gating, component verifier,\n",
    "bootstrap/Wilcoxon/patient-macro promotion rule.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Necessary validation hygiene only\n",
    "\n",
    "For each outer fold, one non-outer fold is used only for epoch selection/early stopping.\n",
    "The selected epoch count is then refit on all four non-outer folds.\n",
    "That prevents tuning on the reported outer fold; it is not an extra GraphMS-Net module.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Stage-11\n",
    "\n",
    "The supplied guide explicitly gives threshold 0.5 and removal of lesions <10 voxels after\n",
    "3-D connected-component analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "The guide also names opening/closing but does not supply a structuring element or iteration count.\n",
    "Those parameters are not invented here.\n",
    "\n",
    "Development 5-fold CV only. No untouched external-test claim.\n",
    "Stages 12\u201314 are performed after this segmentation branch is frozen.\n"
   ]
  },
